<title>USA: 3D Systems introduces epoxy resins.</title>
<headline>3D Systems introduces epoxy resins.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>3D Systems Corp said Friday it was introducing a new type of resins designed for the rapid construction of plastic parts.</p>
<p>3D said the new epoxy resins can help companies speed up designing and making product prototypes.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of solid-imaging systems posted a net income of $388,000, or $0.03 a share, in the quarter ended March 29, compared with $1.1 million, or $0.10, in the corresponding period of the previous year.</p>
<p>3D shares were unchanged at 8-11/16 late Friday afternoon.</p>
